GATE="shellcheck"
EXPECT_EXIT="1"
EXPECT_RULE="SC2164"
DESCRIPTION="An unchecked cd must be caught and attributed to SC2164 specifically. The first version of this fault expected SC2086 (unquoted expansion) and passed green, because SC2086 is info-level and the gate runs at severity>=warning -- the fault was testing a rule the gate was configured not to report. Asserting the code caught that; asserting only the exit status would not have."
